MOVING                          LOOKING                         CHANGING                            
j/k  ↓/↑     select a row       h  ?         this keymap        any char     types into a box       
g/G home/end first / last       b            feed, full screen  ⌫ ↵ esc      erase, file, drop      
J/K          next / prev sheep  F            gather by fold     e            the config pane        
ctrl-d/u     page the feed      z            collapse a fold    space        cycle a value          
←/→          environment tab    o            out / err / both   d            restore default        
tab          next config group  m            minimum level      u            undo the edit          
1-8          jump to a group    f            follow the tail    s            shepherd settings      
n/N          next / prev match  w            wrap long lines    S            secrets                
↵            open selection     /            filter, or match   D            delete a secret        
esc          back one level     r            refresh now        c            leave it running       
                                v            reveal for 10s                                         
                                y            copy the value                                         
                                                                                                    
DOING                                                                                               
x            stop                                                                                   
R            restart                                                                                
L            reload                                                                                 
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
                                                                                                    
